@ApiService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5468

### Product catalog (PostgreSQL)
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/products
Accept: application/json

### Products in one category
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/products?category=Camping
Accept: application/json

### Customer accounts (MySQL)
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/customers/3
Accept: application/json

### Recent orders (SQL Server)
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/orders?limit=5
Accept: application/json

### An order with its lines (SQL Server) and its customer (MySQL)
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/orders/1
Accept: application/json

### Place an order across all three databases
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 3,
  "lines": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": 13, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### 400 validation problem details
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 3,
  "lines": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 0 }
  ]
}

### 404 problem details (unknown customer)
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 999,
  "lines": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### 409 problem details (the tent is out of stock)
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 3,
  "lines": [
    { "productId": 8, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### OpenAPI document
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
